E ExtentRelation             | RenderSchedule.h | 49-54  | contract                      | -  | How a target's extent relates to the display extent. is never touched by a resize. `06` §4.1 gates that both ways.
    has   DisplayRelative    ExtentRelation  [-]  ?
    has   FractionOfDisplay  ExtentRelation  [-]  ?
    has   Absolute           ExtentRelation  [-]  ?
    by    Source/RenderSchedule.cpp
    note  ⚠️ A display-relative target is reclaimed and re-claimed on every extent change; an absolute one

