T DeclaredRecording          | RenderSchedule.h | 73-83  | owning                        | -  | One declared recording. absent capability must degrade to something, and choosing that something belongs to the contributing document rather than to a branch invented at the recording site.
    has   Identity            const char*                [-]  ?
    has   Reads               std::vector<SharedTarget>  [-]  ?
